This package integrates lambda-twelve/one-record, an implementation of the
IATA ONE Record standard, into the Laravel framework. The ONE Record API
specification, the ONE Record cargo ontology, the ONE Record API ontology and
the ONE Record code lists are the work of the International Air Transport
Association (IATA), published at https://github.com/IATA-Cargo/ONE-Record
under the MIT License.
